  "content": "<h1>🌍 傳送石</h1><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&amp;color=blue&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fwarpstones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/warpstones?label=modrinth&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"License\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TtpLXt4.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>📖 模組說明</h2><p>在重要地點放置傳送石，即可在世界中建立快速旅行點。本模組專為生存模式與多人遊戲設計，提供簡單且平衡的快速移動方式！</p><h3>功能特色</h3><ul>\n<li>自訂名稱（使用命名牌）</li>\n<li>發光效果（使用螢光石粉）</li>\n<li>指南針連結</li>\n</ul><p>建議搭配使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252flodestone-update-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">磁石配方回溯模組</a>，即可用鐵錠取代地獄合金錠。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>🛠️ 合成配方</h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C7TvGcL.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>⌨️ 指令列表</h2><p>摧毀所有傳送石：</p><pre><code>/function warpstones:destroy_all_warpstones</code></pre><p>取得傳送石：</p><pre><code>/loot give @s loot warpstones:warpstone</code></pre><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>🪪 授權條款</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>👾 錯誤回報</h2><p>請至<a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>回報任何問題/錯誤。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>💌 贊助支持</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">透過 Ko-Fi 贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">透過 PayPal 贊助</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>🎁 伺服器託管</h2><p>自行建立伺服器可能是個耗時、繁瑣且成本高昂的過程。</p><p>但透過 BisectHosting，您只需點擊幾下就能擁有專屬伺服器！憑藉其 24/7 技術支援與快速響應時間，所有問題都將迎刃而解！感興趣嗎？我們為您準備了專屬優惠！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"伺服器託管\"></p>",
